  "boards": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "rootThreePointFive",
      "root": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "page",
        "kind": "column",
        "children": [
          {
            "id": 2,
            "name": "title",
            "kind": "prop",
            "prop": "text",
            "with": {
              "text": {
                "en": "To find √x for any x: mark AB = x, then BC = 1. Draw a semicircle with AC as diameter. The perpendicular BD is exactly √x long. Tap the blue arrow to swing BD down.",
                "hi": "किसी भी x का √x पाने के लिए: AB = x लो, फिर BC = 1। AC को व्यास मानकर अर्धवृत्त बनाओ। लंब BD ठीक √x लंबा है। BD को नीचे घुमाने के लिए नीले तीर पर टैप करो।"
              },
              "style": "title",
              "speak": {
                "en": "To find the square root of any x: mark A B equal to x, then B C equal to 1. Draw a semicircle with A C as diameter. The perpendicular B D is exactly root x long. Tap the blue arrow to swing B D down.",
                "hi": "किसी भी x का वर्गमूल पाने के लिए: A B बराबर x लो, फिर B C बराबर 1। A C को व्यास मानकर अर्धवृत्त बनाओ। लंब B D ठीक रूट x लंबा है। B D को नीचे घुमाने के लिए नीले तीर पर टैप करो।"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 3,
            "name": "semicircle",
            "kind": "prop",
            "prop": "rootSemicircle",
            "with": {
              "x": 3.5
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 4,
            "name": "why",
            "kind": "row",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 5,
                "name": "proof",
                "kind": "prop",
                "prop": "button",
                "with": {
                  "label": {
                    "en": "Why does it work?",
                    "hi": "यह क्यों काम करता है?"
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 6,
            "name": "mayaWhy",
            "kind": "prop",
            "isHidden": true,
            "prop": "line",
            "with": {
              "character": "maya",
              "line": {
                "en": "O is the middle of AC, so OD = OC = (x + 1)/2. OB = OC − BC = (x + 1)/2 − 1 = (x − 1)/2. Pythagoras: BD² = OD² − OB² = ((x + 1)² − (x − 1)²)/4 = 4x/4 = x.",
                "hi": "O, AC का मध्य-बिंदु है, इसलिए OD = OC = (x + 1)/2। OB = OC − BC = (x + 1)/2 − 1 = (x − 1)/2। पाइथागोरस से: BD² = OD² − OB² = ((x + 1)² − (x − 1)²)/4 = 4x/4 = x।"
              },
              "speak": {
                "en": "O is the middle of A C, so O D equals O C, which is x plus 1 over 2. O B is O C minus B C, which is x minus 1 over 2. By Pythagoras, B D squared is O D squared minus O B squared, which works out to 4 x over 4, which is x.",
                "hi": "O, A C का मध्य-बिंदु है, इसलिए O D बराबर O C, यानी x जोड़ 1 बटा 2। O B बराबर O C माइनस B C, यानी x माइनस 1 बटा 2। पाइथागोरस से, B D का वर्ग, O D के वर्ग माइनस O B के वर्ग, यानी 4 x बटा 4, यानी x है।"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 7,
            "name": "arjunLanded",
            "kind": "prop",
            "isHidden": true,
            "prop": "line",
            "with": {
              "character": "arjun",
              "line": {
                "en": "Taking B as 0, the point E is √3.5. This works for any positive x.",
                "hi": "B को 0 मानें तो बिंदु E, √3.5 है। यह किसी भी धनात्मक x के लिए काम करता है।"
              },
              "speak": {
                "en": "Taking B as 0, the point E is the square root of 3.5. This works for any positive x.",
                "hi": "B को 0 मानें तो बिंदु E, 3.5 का वर्गमूल है। यह किसी भी धनात्मक x के लिए काम करता है।"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 8,
            "name": "rest",
            "kind": "space"
          }
        ]
      },
      "is": [],
      "when": [
        {
          "on": "board.started",
          "do": {
            "call": "title.say"
          }
        },
        {
          "on": "proof.pressed",
          "do": [
