                  "id": "twoAndHalf",
                  "label": {
                    "en": "2.5",
                    "hi": "2.5"
                  },
                  "feedback": {
                    "en": "2.5 is the radius, (4 + 1)/2. BD² = x: what number squared is 4?",
                    "hi": "2.5 तो त्रिज्या है, (4 + 1)/2। BD² = x: किस संख्या का वर्ग 4 है?"
                  },
                  "misconception": "constructionNotLinkedToRoot"
                }
              ],
              "answer": "two",
              "concepts": [
                "root-of-any-number"
              ],
              "speak": {
                "en": "Suppose A B is 4, so x is 4. Without measuring: how long is B D?",
                "hi": "मान लो A B बराबर 4, यानी x बराबर 4। बिना नापे बताओ: B D कितना लंबा है?"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 4,
            "name": "mayaTwo",
            "kind": "prop",
            "isHidden": true,
            "prop": "line",
            "with": {
              "character": "maya",
              "line": {
                "en": "BD = √4 = 2: swung down, it lands exactly on 2.",
                "hi": "BD = √4 = 2: नीचे घुमाने पर यह ठीक 2 पर आती है।"
              },
              "speak": {
                "en": "B D is root 4, which is 2: swung down, it lands exactly on 2.",
                "hi": "B D बराबर रूट 4, यानी 2: नीचे घुमाने पर यह ठीक 2 पर आती है।"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "id": 5,
            "name": "rest",
            "kind": "space"
          }
        ]
